WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.240
What's up guys we're Pongfinity!

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.862
It's minus 20 celsius here in Finland

00:00:10.862 --> 00:00:14.309
so we thought it's a perfect weather to play outside.

00:00:14.309 --> 00:00:16.285
So let's make an ice table!

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.840
It's gonna be a mystery how&nbsp;well we can play on this.

00:00:51.446 --> 00:00:53.173
So, what's the plan?

00:00:53.173 --> 00:00:56.426
So first we'll take this snow&nbsp;out of here.

00:00:59.687 --> 00:01:01.463
Then we're gonna measure the table.

00:01:03.383 --> 00:01:05.400
Take the snow away from the edges.

00:01:07.431 --> 00:01:08.640
Then put some water on it.

00:01:11.082 --> 00:01:11.781
Let it freeze.

00:01:13.788 --> 00:01:14.851
Yeah it should&nbsp;be fine.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.101
Lets crack it on!

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:16.820
Yeah!

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.563
We have this old-fashioned measure here.

00:01:25.916 --> 00:01:26.701
152.

00:01:33.487 --> 00:01:35.364
I think we are ready to play.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.409
Otto I have an idea.

00:01:39.409 --> 00:01:40.408
Go stand on it.

00:01:40.408 --> 00:01:41.135
Yeah.

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.661
Yes, thanks!

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:23.670
If someone was to take this out of context...

00:02:24.425 --> 00:02:25.683
Normal day in Finland!

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.950
Recently I've found myself jumping awfully a lot.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:44.748
Sensei says...

00:02:46.659 --> 00:02:47.640
Almost perfect!

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:51.782
I think we're ready with that!

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.485
What are you laughing at?

00:02:55.485 --> 00:02:56.408
Can i touch&nbsp;it?

00:02:56.408 --> 00:02:57.134
No.

00:02:57.134 --> 00:03:00.733
This one, it almost looks like a tooth!

00:03:01.341 --> 00:03:02.698
It's like a tooth sticking out!

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:05.808
Chop chop chop chop..

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.716
This is quite satisfying.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.119
It's impressive!

00:03:19.119 --> 00:03:20.102
Nice table!

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.260
After two hours.

00:03:24.245 --> 00:03:27.452
Just to make sure&nbsp;there isn't any weird bounces

00:03:27.452 --> 00:03:30.536
which there probably will be but trying to&nbsp;minimize those.

00:03:32.288 --> 00:03:34.340
This side is a bit more up.

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.068
Yeah I think that's good enough.

00:03:42.567 --> 00:03:43.680
Lets go&nbsp;to the lake!

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.000
We're gonna get some water.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.717
We have to break the ice to get some water.

00:03:50.397 --> 00:03:52.822
What is a frozen lake's worst nightmare?

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.077
Sensei with an axe!

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.956
Emil I have a question for you.

00:04:09.589 --> 00:04:11.282
What's Miikka's worst nightmare?

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.270
Oooh I'm through!

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:28.816
Water, there's water!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.255
It's frozen again.

00:04:41.255 --> 00:04:42.560
Noooo.

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:54.777
Finnish winter, a lot of snow,&nbsp;beautiful sunshine.

00:04:55.252 --> 00:04:56.193
What could be better?

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.548
It already froze!

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:10.307
There's like a five centimeter thing

00:05:10.307 --> 00:05:11.875
where you can go around the net here.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:18.300
This is again one of those projects that it's really interesting

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:19.948
like you don't know what's going to happen

00:05:19.948 --> 00:05:22.429
or&nbsp;does it even work so it's quite cool!

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.555
Yeah I mean this looks so cool!

00:05:28.555 --> 00:05:30.957
It almost feels&nbsp;like you would immediately want to try it

00:05:30.957 --> 00:05:32.917
but we have to wait for tomorrow!

00:05:34.377 --> 00:05:35.892
Feeling quite hard already.

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:45.897
Look at that surface!

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:47.152
It's&nbsp;pretty cool!

00:05:47.784 --> 00:05:48.980
Yeah more water!

00:05:50.129 --> 00:05:52.402
Oooooh it's getting smooth!

00:05:53.071 --> 00:05:54.753
The table must be pretty cold.

00:05:57.993 --> 00:06:01.190
We're off to the frozen lake.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.228
Now that's a&nbsp;bucket!

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.535
It's not gonna break that's for sure!

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:15.806
Looking forward to tomorrow!

00:06:22.791 --> 00:06:24.116
Beautiful&nbsp;morning.

00:06:24.408 --> 00:06:27.684
Morning coffee by the fireplace, what could be better.

00:06:29.266 --> 00:06:32.803
So, day two, it's -17 degrees&nbsp;today.

00:06:33.228 --> 00:06:34.459
It should be rock solid.

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:36.000
If I go stand there..

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.876
It can take the weight of an Emil.

00:06:38.876 --> 00:06:39.711
Emil solid!

00:06:39.711 --> 00:06:41.967
So 250 kilos.

00:06:41.967 --> 00:06:45.284
So if it takes Emil's weight it should be able to take the table tennis balls weight.

00:06:45.284 --> 00:06:47.103
Yeah I would think that.

00:06:47.395 --> 00:06:48.897
The most important thing.

00:06:48.897 --> 00:06:50.496
The Pongfinity logo!

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:04.456
It's a rough estimate&nbsp;of our logo.

00:07:04.456 --> 00:07:05.843
So shall we do the edges?

00:07:07.559 --> 00:07:10.504
Yeah this is pretty much a must do because otherwise

00:07:11.186 --> 00:07:15.403
it's very difficult to see the lines on camera.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:18.983
There!

00:07:19.263 --> 00:07:20.411
The moment of truth.

00:07:20.728 --> 00:07:22.569
Drop it Miikka, drop the ball!

00:07:22.569 --> 00:07:24.163
Has all the effort been for nothing.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.947
Oh it does! Very good.

00:07:28.947 --> 00:07:29.840
It's a bit random.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.890
It bounces, that's very good!

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.281
The black ball is quite&nbsp;cool!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:35.611
Shall we do it?

00:07:35.611 --> 00:07:36.130
Yeah.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.475
Okay, are you ready?

00:07:38.475 --> 00:07:39.000
I am!

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:57.859
Sidespin!

00:07:59.943 --> 00:08:00.903
That was a good serve.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:12.626
Nice one!

00:08:18.558 --> 00:08:19.058
Hello!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:24.875
Was it around the net?

00:08:24.875 --> 00:08:25.914
It was!

00:08:35.929 --> 00:08:36.815
Nice rally!

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:51.090
Whoa what a spin!

00:08:51.516 --> 00:08:52.320
Backspin.

00:09:04.005 --> 00:09:07.292
Alright so this was quite an arctic idea.

00:09:10.204 --> 00:09:11.763
Well yes it was!

00:09:11.763 --> 00:09:13.713
Nice one Emil!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.064
But it also&nbsp;worked out really well.

00:09:17.064 --> 00:09:18.171
Yeah it was fine.

00:09:18.171 --> 00:09:19.394
Better than i expected.

00:09:19.905 --> 00:09:22.518
Yeah thanks for watching and until next time!

00:09:24.896 --> 00:09:26.202
Straight onto the lens..

